  "id": "BIT-golang-2026-56864",
  "summary": "Ignore unrelated, unauthenticated hashes in Lookup in golang.org/x/mod/sumdb",
  "details": "A malicious GOSUMDB was capable of serving arbitrary module content not contained within the transparency log. This attack allows for a coordinating GOPROXY and GOSUMDB to serve a client malicious module content that cannot be detected by evaluating the transparency log. In order to determine if you have been affected: rm -r go.sum go.work.sum vendor/ && go mod tidy",
